1
00:00:00,907 --> 00:00:02,537
(Sheldon:)Mr. D'Onofrio?

2
00:00:02,742 --> 00:00:04,122
It's me, Sheldon.

3
00:00:05,579 --> 00:00:08,869
(Sheldon:)They didn't have anything
barber-themed in the gift shop...

4
00:00:09,082 --> 00:00:11,082
(Sheldon:)...so I got you this.

5
00:00:11,293 --> 00:00:15,713
(Sheldon:)Don't know if you can read his little
T- shirt. It says, "Get well beary soon."

6
00:00:17,716 --> 00:00:20,676
(Sheldon:)Trust me, if you were even a little
conscious right now, you'd be laughing.

7
00:00:24,514 --> 00:00:26,344
(Howard:)Anyway...

8
00:00:27,851 --> 00:00:29,481
(Sheldon:)There's new studies that show...

9
00:00:29,686 --> 00:00:33,936
(Sheldon:)...people in comas are aware
of everything going on around them.

10
00:00:34,149 --> 00:00:36,859
(Sheldon:)With that in mind, if you can hear me...

11
00:00:37,068 --> 00:00:42,618
(Sheldon:)...move away from the light
and toward the sound of these scissors.

12
00:00:43,909 --> 00:00:46,619
- Can I help you?
- Yes.

13
00:00:46,828 --> 00:00:50,208
(Sheldon:)Do you have something
l could use as a cape?

14
00:00:51,208 --> 00:00:54,588
(Nurse:)Oh, dear, did we spit out our pills,
slip out of the ninth floor...

15
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:56,794
(Nurse:)...and go on a little adventure?

16
00:00:58,215 --> 00:01:05,025
Oh, no, I'm just here
to get my hair cut.

